$400","0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3YcHCGQoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3IcHCGMoDA",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3IcHCGUoDQ",null,null,null,[3],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3IcHCGYoDg",null,null,null,[3],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3IcHCGcoDw",null,null,null,[3],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_LOUD"],"吵雜，但還是能交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3YcHCGkoAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3IcHCGgoEA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_UP_TO_10_MIN"],"最多 10 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3YcHCGsoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjBiMOY8tSWAxUqha8BHc-9BlEQ3IcHCGooEQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["🍜位於西門町絕佳位置的「ラーメン凪 (Nagi) 拉麵」，是許多拉麵迷心中「創意與穩定」的代名詞。這間源自日本、紅遍全球的拉麵店，其西門分店位於大樓 6 樓，環境寬敞且充滿熱鬧的日式氣氛，特別適合在西門商圈逛累後，與朋友一同享受一碗熱騰騰的濃厚系豚骨拉麵。\n🍜\u200b口味特色：經典四大天王與無限驚喜\n\u200bNagi 最為人稱道的是其鮮明的「四大天王」湯頭：豚王（經典原味）、黑王（黑麻油與墨魚汁）、赤王（香辣豆瓣）以及翠王（羅勒與起司）。\n🍜\u200b豚王： 湯頭基底極其濃厚，豬骨熬煮出的膠質感十足，入口鹹香帶甜，卻不會有過重的豬臊味。\n🍜\u200b黑王： 是這裡的視覺重心，黑壓壓的湯頭中蘊含著濃郁的海味與蒜香，配上一顆特製的黑王球（肉燥），攪拌後味道層次多變。\n🍜\u200b限定王： Nagi 每週都會推出限量的「限定王」，從義式番茄到台式風味都有可能出現，這種不斷翻新的創意，讓常客每次回訪都有驚喜。\n🍜\u200b客製化體驗：打造你的專屬風味\n\u200b點餐採用的客製化菜單是其一大特色。從湯頭的濃淡、蒜泥的量、叉燒的部位（豬肩肉或豬腹肉）、蔬菜種類（高麗菜或青蔥），到麵條的軟硬度與粗細，都能依照個人喜好調整。對於工程師或專案管理者這類重視邏輯與細節的食客來說，這種精確的控制感非常討喜。此外，桌面上免費提供的豆芽菜與辣雪裡紅更是神來之筆，清脆爽口的辣豆芽能有效緩解豚骨湯底的濃厚，讓人不知不覺就吃完一整碗。\n🍜\u200b服務與環境\n\u200b西門店的空間相對開闊，且充滿活力的招呼聲讓人倍感親切。雖然用餐尖峰時段往往需要排隊，但由於點餐流程流暢，翻桌速度相當快。\n🍜\u200b總結評價\n🍜\u200b推薦必點： 初訪建議選「豚王」，重口味愛好者必試「黑王」。\n🍜\u200b性價比： 中價位，但穩定的品質與極具誠意的湯頭份量，對得起其排隊名氣。\n🍜\u200b小叮嚀： 建議加點半熟蛋（味玉），熟度掌握得恰到好處，蛋黃流心感極佳。\n\u200b這是一碗能帶來飽足感與多重味覺撞擊的拉麵，無論是想體驗日式職人精神，還是單純追求極致的濃郁口感，Nagi 都能交出令人滿意的成績單。",null,[0,147]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VUdOR1pIVlViR3Q1Vkd4b01GTnFiRXhPYm14T1ZVYzVURTR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VUdOR1pIVlViR3Q1Vkd4b01GTnFiRXhPYm14T1ZVYzVURTR4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VUdOR1pIVlViR3Q1Vkd4b01GTnFiRXhPYm14T1ZVYzVURTR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VUdOR1pIVlViR3Q1Vkd4b01GTnFiRXhPYm14T1ZVYzVURTR4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VUdOR1pIVlViR3Q1Vkd4b01GTnFiRXhPYm14T1ZVYzVURTR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3VUdOR1pIVlViR3Q1Vkd4b01GTnFiRXhPYm14T1ZVYzVURTR4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,23127,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wUGNGZHVUbGt5VGxoMFNqbExObmxOVUc5TE4xRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x10d848775316cc7b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnpPcFduTlkyTlh0SjlLNnlNUG9LN1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wUGNGZHVUbGt5VGxoMFNqbExObmxOVUc5TE4xRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wUGNGZHVUbGt5VGxoMFNqbExObmxOVUc5TE4xRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wUGNGZHVUbGt5VGxoMFNqbExObmxOVUc5TE4xRRILMGRmSTN6YzN2NkkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09ucFBjRmR1VGxreVRsaDBTamxMTm5sTlVHOUxOMUUSCzBkZkkzemMzdjZJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARe8wWU3dI2BAqCzBkZkkzemMzdjZJ\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\